    {
      "bbox": [
        324,
        1121,
        1654,
        1403
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "Shortly, members of the Classification Staff, who are\ndeveloping the Career and Salary Plan, will call upon you to\npresent the tentative plan as it affects the classification of\npositions in your agency, to solicit your comments and sugges-\ntions regarding the plan, and to get certain information needed\nto bring the plan up to date as of June 2, 1951. Proposed salary\nschedules will not be considered at this time.",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 21,
          "mean": -0.2179,
          "min": -1.4505
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
          "mean": -0.0,
          "min": -0.0
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 97,
          "mean": -0.0029,
          "min": -0.1843
        }
      },
      "ink": {
        "ink_px": 43957,
        "area_px": 373650,
        "density": 0.11764,
        "chars": 416,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 9.46
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        319,
        1447,
        1613,
        1647
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "At this stage the tentative classification plan to be con-\nsidered will be suitable only for discussion with you or such\nindividuals as you may designate in your department or agency.\nUntil the final plan is released by the Mayor's Committee on\nManagement Survey, it will be treated as confidential.",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 21,
          "mean": -0.259,
          "min": -1.5195
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
          "mean": -0.0,
          "min": -0.0
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 61,
          "mean": -0.014,
          "min": -0.5516
        }
      },
      "ink": {
        "ink_px": 27829,
        "area_px": 257800,
        "density": 0.10795,
        "chars": 299,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 10.74
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        312,
        1689,
        1648,
        2134
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "I know that I can count on you for the fullest cooperation\nin this highly important project. It is in the interest of the\nCity, of your agency and your employees to make certain that the\nClassification Staff receives from you both your suggestions on\nthe classification plan and the prompt completion of the facts\nneeded from your agency. I trust that I am not setting too tight\na schedule when I ask that you personally see to it that your\nagency completes its part of this job within ten days after you\nreceive the request from the Classification Staff representative.\nThis request for an interview with you will come within the next\nfew days.",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 21,
          "mean": -0.2558,
          "min": -1.2509
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
